{"id":"cc92w3d9y8vpvwqtxlwymi71o","title":"GitHub Actions 新增锁文件机制防范供应链攻击","originalTitle":"Lock your GitHub Actions","summary":"GitHub Actions 在 2026 年 11 月正式支持工作流锁文件，通过锁定依赖库的版本号（如 v7.0.1、v3.1.0）避免恶意代码替换。作者演示了使用 `gh actions-lock` 工具生成锁文件（actions.lock）的配置方法，并建议通过 `zizmor` 工具验证锁文件有效性。","reason":"GitHub Actions 新增锁文件机制，通过版本号锁定依赖库，有效防范恶意代码替换风险，开发者需更新工作流配置适配此功能。","source":{"name":"Lobsters 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://hugovk.dev/blog/2026/lock-github-actions/"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T18:16:01.014Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-11T18:58:00.241Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-11T18:58:00.241Z","category":"security-privacy","tags":["新项目","版本发布","GitHub"],"score":76,"selected":true,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"2ff2d9fb-a8ab-46e7-855b-69c7cfc94df0","title":"GitHub正式部署工作流依赖锁定文件机制防范供应链攻击"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"2ff2d9fb-a8ab-46e7-855b-69c7cfc94df0","title":"GitHub正式部署工作流依赖锁定文件机制防范供应链攻击"}],"topics":[{"slug":"github","name":"GitHub"},{"slug":"new-project","name":"新项目首发"},{"slug":"major-release","name":"重大版本发布"}],"indexable":true,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fyghA1VwDb7o","reportCount":2,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}